msgstr "Navštivte pretix pro získání vstupenky."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:45 src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:123
msgid "Join Discord"
msgstr "Přidejte se na Discord"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:46
msgid "Using the invite link"
msgstr "Použijte odkaz s pozvánkou"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:51 src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:140
msgid "Register in Discord"
msgstr "Zaregistrujte se na Discordu"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:52
msgid "With your <b>Name</b> and <b>Order number</b>"
msgstr "Se svým <b>Jménem</b> a <b>Číslem objednávky</b>"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:57
msgid "Enjoy the conference!"
msgstr "Užijte si konferenci!"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:58
msgid "Check the server structure"
msgstr "Podívejte se na strukturu severu"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:66
msgid "The online venue of the conference"
msgstr "Místo naší konference"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:67
msgid "Attending PyLadiesCon"
msgstr "Účast na PyLadiesCon"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:69
msgid ""
"Join the conference Discord server to meet every participant, including "
"presenters, volunteers and organizers. Enjoy workshops, sprints, open "
"spaces, get stream links, and many more activities!"
msgstr ""
"Přidejte se na Discord server konference a poznejte všechny účastníky včetně "
"přednášejících, dobrovolníků a organizátorů. Užijte si workshopy, sprinty a "
"otevřené prostory, získejte odkazy na streamy a mnoho dalších aktivit!"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:70
msgid "Follow the next steps to enjoy the conference:"
msgstr "Ještě pár kroků a můžete se k nám přidat:"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:81
msgid "Update"
msgstr "Aktualizace"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:81
msgid "The discord server is available!"
msgstr "Discord je přístupný!"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:118
msgid ""
"<span class=\"font-bold\">Important:</span> every participant needs a <a "
"class=\"underline\" href=\"https://pretix.eu/pyladiescon/2026\">conference "
"ticket</a> in order to access the right channels in the Discord server; "
"including Participants, Volunteers, and Sponsors."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"font-bold\">Důležité:</span> každá účastnice a účastník "
"potřebuje <a class=\"underline\" href=\"https://pretix.eu/pyladiescon/"
"2026\">vstupenku</a> pro přístup do všech kanálů na Discordu, nevyjímaje "
"účastnictvo, dobrovolnictvo a sponzory."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:120
msgid ""
"You can get a conference ticket on <a href=\"https://pretix.eu/pyladiescon/"
"2026\">our pretix page</a>."
msgstr ""
"Vstupenku na konferenci můžete získat na <a href=\"https://pretix.eu/"
"pyladiescon/2026\">našem pretixu</a>."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:131
msgid ""
"<span class=\"font-medium\"><b>Note:</b></span> In case you already have a "
"Discord account, you don't need to create a new one."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"font-medium\"><b>Pozor:</b></span> Pokud už máte účet na "
"Discordu, nepotřebujete vytvářet nový."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:135
msgid "More information soon"
msgstr "Více informací už brzy"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:136
msgid ""
"We will share the invite link closer to the conference. Every participant "
"also receives it by email before the event."
msgstr ""
"Odkaz s pozvánkou zveřejníme blíž ke konferenci. Každý účastník ho navíc "
"dostane e-mailem před začátkem akce."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:143
msgid ""
"Once inside the server, head to the <code class=\"text-"
"accent\">#registration-form</code> channel, click on the <button "
"type=\"button\" class=\"focus:outline-none text-white bg-green-700 hover:bg-"
"green-800 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-green-300 font-medium rounded-lg text-sm "
"px-3 py-2 dark:bg-green-600 dark:hover:bg-green-700 dark:focus:ring-"
"green-800\">Register here 👈</button> button and a modal window will open, "
"where you will need to enter your <b>Name</b> and <b>Ticket number</b>."
msgstr ""
"Po otevření serveru, klikněte na <code class=\"text-accent\">#registration-"
"form</code>, pak na odkaz <button type=\"button\" class=\"focus:outline-none "
"text-white bg-green-700 hover:bg-green-800 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-green-300 "
"font-medium rounded-lg text-sm px-3 py-2 dark:bg-green-600 dark:hover:bg-"
"green-700 dark:focus:ring-green-800\">Register here 👈</button>, co otevře "
"okno, do kterého napište své <b>Jméno</b> a <b>Číslo objednávky</b>."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:144
msgid ""
"You need to enter <b>the exact</b> information from your conference ticket, "
"that you received via email with a subject:<br><code class=\"text-ink-"
"muted\">[PyLadiesCon 2026] Your order: XXXXX</code>, when you acquired the "
"ticket."
msgstr ""
"Musíte napsat <b>tu stejnou</b> informaci, jako je na vašem lístku, který "
"jste obdrželi mailem s předmětem <br><code class=\"text-ink-"
"muted\">[PyLadiesCon 2026] Your order: XXXXX</code>."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:146
msgid "Joining as an Participant"
msgstr "Jsem účastnictvo"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:148
msgid ""
"If this is your first PyLadiesCon, you should join Discord with the link "
"that it will be sent to you a week before the conference."
msgstr ""
"Pokud je to váš první PyLadiesCon, přidejte se do Discordu pomocí odkazu, "
"který vám zašleme zhruba týden před konferencí."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:149
msgid ""
"Once you register successfully, you will get assigned the <code class=\"text-"
"yellow-400\">Participant</code> role."
msgstr ""
"Po úspěšné registraci dostanete roli  <code class=\"text-"
"yellow-400\">Participant</code>."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:151
msgid "Joining as a Sponsor"
msgstr "Jsem sponzor"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:153
msgid ""
"If you are from a company that is <b>sponsoring the conference</b>, and you "
"will participate in the many activities like Panel Discussion, Speed "
"Interview, sharing information in your company's channel, you need to get a "
"ticket with the <b>Voucher</b> that it will be sent to you, through the "
"contact person at your company."
msgstr ""
"Pokud jste z firmy <b>sponzorující konferenci</b> a zúčastníte se aktivit "
"jako jsou diskuzní panel, rychlý pohovor nebo sdílení informací o firmě na "
"kanále firmy, zaregistrujte vstupenku pomoci <b>Voucheru</b>, který vám "
"zašle kontaktní osoba z firmy."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:154
msgid ""
"This is very important for you to get the <code class=\"text-"
"yellow-400\">Sponsor</code> role."
msgstr ""
"Tohle je velmi důležité pro získání role <code class=\"text-"
"yellow-400\">Sponsor</code>."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:156
msgid "Joining as a Presenter"
msgstr "Připojení jako přednášející"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:158
msgid ""
"If you have a session, you will get a ticket using the Voucher that we will "
"send you via email. The reason behind this is to automatically assign you "
"the <code class=\"text-yellow-400\">Presenter</code> role."
msgstr ""
"Pokud máte svou sekci, vstupenku získáte pomocí voucheru, který vám pošleme "
"e-mailem. Důvodem je automatické přiřazení role <code class=\"text-"
"yellow-400\">Presenter</code>."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:160
msgid "Joining as a Volunteer"
msgstr "Jsem dobrovolnictvo"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:162
msgid ""
"If you are a conference Volunteer, it's highly probable you are already "
"inside the server, but you <span class=\"text-red-500\">will not</span> have "
"access to the conference channels as long as you don't get a conference "
"ticket, and do the registration process described at the top of this page."
msgstr ""
"Pokud dobrovolničíte na konferenci, pravděpodobně už máte přístup na server, "
"ale <span class=\"text-red-500\">nedostanete</span> přístup do kanálů "
"konference, dokud se nezaregistrujete jako účastnictvo, pomocí postupu "
"popsaného výše na stránce."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:163
msgid ""
"If by some reason you haven't been assigned the <code class=\"text-"
"yellow-400\">Volunteer</code> contact the organization in the <code "
"class=\"text-accent\">#volunteers-general</code> channel."
msgstr ""
"Pokud nemáte na sobě roli <code class=\"text-yellow-400\">Volunteer</code>, "
"kontaktujte organizátorstvo v kanálu <code class=\"text-accent\">#volunteers-"
"general</code>."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:166
msgid "The server structure"
msgstr "Struktura serveru"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:169
msgid ""
"Once you join the server, you will see two categories, one called "
"<b>Conference Information</b> with two channels:"
msgstr ""
"Po přidání se na server uvidíte dvě kategorie, jednu pojmenovanou "
"<b>Conference Information</b> se dvěma kanály:"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:171
msgid ""
"a text channel called <code class=\"text-accent\">#rules</code>, with the "
"rules of the server, and"
msgstr ""
"textový kanál <code class=\"text-accent\">#rules</code> s pravidly serveru, a"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:172
msgid ""
"a text channel called <code class=\"text-accent\">#code-of-conduct</code>, "
"with the guidelines to participate in the event"
msgstr ""
"textový kanál <code class=\"text-accent\">#code-of-conduct</code> s pravidly "
"účasti v konferenci"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:174
msgid "Another category called <b>Registration</b> with two channels:"
msgstr "Druha kategorie je <b>Registration</b> se dvěma kanály:"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:176
msgid ""
"a text channel called <code class=\"text-accent\">#registration-form</code> "
"where you can see the button to register, and"
msgstr ""
"textový kanál <code class=\"text-accent\">#registration-form</code>, kde "
"najdete odkaz k registraci"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:177
msgid ""
"a forum channel called <code class=\"text-accent\">💬registration-help</"
"code>, where you can ask any question regarding the registration process."
msgstr ""
"fórum pojmenované <code class=\"text-accent\">💬registration-help</code>, "
"kde se můžete ptát na proces registrace."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:179
msgid ""
"If you have any question after you registered, you can leave your question "
"in the <code class=\"text-accent\">💬help</code> forum."
msgstr ""
"Pokud máte otázky po registraci, ptejte se na fóru <code class=\"text-"
"accent\">💬help</code>."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:181
msgid "Get the latest updates"
msgstr "Nepropásněte žádně novinky"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:183
msgid ""
"Once registered, the <b>Conference Information</b> will contains more "
"channels:"
msgstr "Po registraci <b>Conference Information</b> se rozšíří o další kanály:"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:185
msgid ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#announcements</code>, to get the general "
"conference announcements,"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#announcements</code> pro obecné konferenční "
"oznámení,"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:186
msgid ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#outreach-social-media</code>, to get the "
"conference posts on social media, so you can share them,"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#outreach-social-media</code>, kde najdete "
"připravené posty na social media, které můžete sdílet,"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:187
msgid ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#donations</code>, to track the donations "
"through <a href=\"https://pretix.eu/pyladiescon/2026\">Pretix</a> during the "
"conference,"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#donations</code>, pro sledování dotací na <a "
"href=\"https://pretix.eu/pyladiescon/2026\">Pretixu</a> během konference,"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:188
msgid ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#session-notifications</code>, to know the "
"upcoming talks and events,"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#session-notifications</code> pro upozornění na "
"nejbližší přednášky a události,"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:189
msgid ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#global-events</code>, to discover events "
"happening in the rest of the world."
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#global-events</code>, pro nalezení akcí "
"konaných v jiných částech světa."

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:192
msgid "Interact with others"
msgstr "Bavte se s ostatními"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:194
msgid ""
"The <b>Conference</b> category will be visible once you register, and will "
"contain the following channels:"
msgstr ""
"Kategorie <b>Conference</b> se zobrazí po registraci, a bude obsahovat "
"následující:"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:196
msgid ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#introductions</code>, for you to introduce "
"yourself and say hi to others,"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#introductions</code> pro představení a "
"přivítání se s ostatními,"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:197
msgid ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#general</code>, for a general conference "
"discussion,"
msgstr "<code class=\"text-accent\">#general</code>, pro obecnou diskuzi,"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:198
msgid ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#networking</code>, so you can share your social "
"media to connect with others,"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#networking</code> pro sdílení profilů v social "
"mediích,"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:199
msgid ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#random</code>, for any discussion not related "
"to the conference,"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#random</code> pro diskuse nesouvisející s "
"konferencí,"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:200
msgid ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#job-board</code>, in case you are looking for "
"job offers,"
msgstr "<code class=\"text-accent\">#job-board</code>, pokud hledáš práci,"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:201
msgid ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#resources</code>, for sharing python-related "
"resources,"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#resources</code>, pro sdílení materiálů ohledně "
"Pythonu,"

#: src/pages/[lang]/attending.astro:202
msgid ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#news-discussion</code>, to interact with the "
"latest Python/PyLadies blog posts,"
msgstr ""
"<code class=\"text-accent\">#news-discussion</code>, kde se můžete bavit o "
"posledních blog postech Pythonu a PyLadies,"

